{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"audio-to-midi-transcriber UI copy.details","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"audio-to-midi-transcriber.copy.details","keys":["audio-to-midi-transcriber.copy.details"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Penjelajah mendekodi berkas yang dipilih, mencampurkan salurannya ke mono, dan memperkirakan nada pengulangan terkuat dalam bingkai audio pendek. Anda dapat menyunting setiap not MIDI yang dideteksi, awal, panjang dan kecepatannya, lalu secara opcional menyatukan peristiwa ke grid tempo.","record_id":"688d4bcc62bdd565c5398e062994ebd86178d22d0d1ba8309bbfd2d723635c06","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":0.7650518516250031,"source":"The browser decodes the selected file, mixes its channels to mono, and estimates the strongest repeating pitch in short audio frames. You can edit every detected MIDI note, its start, length and velocity, then optionally align events to a tempo grid.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"263491686cbfd5555b6d773646a44389932e22027e5bb3b9dc8fc4c5e5ffaedd","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Penjelajah mendekodi berkas yang dipilih, mencampurkan salurannya ke mono, dan memperkirakan nada pengulangan terkuat dalam bingkai audio pendek. Anda dapat menyunting setiap not MIDI yang dideteksi, awal, panjang dan kecepatannya, lalu secara opcional menyatukan peristiwa ke grid tempo.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
