{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"jass-game UI copy.example","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"jass-game.copy.example","keys":["jass-game.copy.example"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Jack trump mengalahkan semua trump lainnya. Nilai kartunya adalah ZXQPH0000QXZ poin; sembilan trump adalah yang berikutnya dalam peringkat dan bernilai ZXQPH0001QXZ. Trik terakhir menambahkan poin ZXQPH0002QXZ, sehingga total poin menjadi ZXQPH0003QXZ.","record_id":"68624c78f2f8b62802e6c4c1c6677a22f131ad6aa1d2dd5a63468a8a1f39b603","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.2663634872500324,"source":"A trump Jack beats every other trump. Its card value is 20 points; the trump Nine is next in rank and worth 14. The last trick adds 5 points, bringing the deal to 157 points in total.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"17c21fe9d613c8d3042d4ed570c28e8cd5223309716080e295bc661f671b90f8","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Jack trump mengalahkan semua trump lainnya. Nilai kartunya adalah 20 poin; sembilan trump adalah yang berikutnya dalam peringkat dan bernilai 14. Trik terakhir menambahkan poin 5, sehingga total poin menjadi 157.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
